  "body": "Due to the evolving nature of how we process and store events, exactly what the handlers should look like and how they are split up should be reviewed.\n\nFor example, we currently have a lot of the event processing code in the base handler, which does not seem the most intuitive place to put it.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-239)\n\n(Reported by @erikjohnston)",
